ue  K  Fibrous tissue  medial margin  L  Fibrous tissue  lateral margin  Resident  SOHEIL DADRAS  MD  PHD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION   report_end  , Present.
